This album will forever be connected to that crazy chapter of history Gunna’s sophomore album WUNNA arrived on May 22, 2020, during the height of the COVID-19 pandemic. With much of the world stuck at home and dealing with uncertainty, the album offered listeners a welcome escape through its smooth production, relaxed atmosphere, and luxurious themes.

Which project would you put up against this?

